# GitOps MCP

Kustomize GitOps manifests for HTTP MCP servers in namespace `mcp-servers`.

Cursor uses `.cursor/rules/` (this file + org common). Legacy `.cursorrules` remains for other editors.

## Key paths

- `mcp-servers/<name>/` — deployment, service, configmap, `secret.yaml.example`
- Root `kustomization.yaml` — wire new servers here

## Conventions

- Labels: `app`, `component: mcp-server`, `managed-by: gitops`
- Naming: `{server}-mcp`; HTTP transport port 8000; probes on `/health`
- Never commit live `secret.yaml`; non-root UID 1000; drop capabilities
- Validate with `kubectl apply --dry-run=client` before merge
